Brand brand kit export checklist
title end

paragraph start
The brand kit is exported as one folder that anyone can pick up without asking questions. This checklist is run every time the brand changes.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Run it in order and do not publish the kit until every line is checked and the files open on a clean machine.
paragraph end

code start
language: text
voice pages exported
words lists exported
palette swatches exported
fonts and licence notes included
logo set included
overlay set included
templates included
do and do not pairs included
no passwords or secrets inside
code end

paragraph start
todo: run the checklist after the first complete version
